+  /**
+   * Native-resolution D3D12 DLAA host backed by Vulkan/D3D12 shared images.
+   *
+   * RTX Remix renders through Vulkan, while the RenoDX DLSS 5 ReShade add-on
+   * observes D3D12 NGX evaluations. This bridge gives both APIs access to the
